    title: "Bulk Credit Repair Leads: A Guide for High-Volume Companies",
    metaTitle: "Bulk Credit Repair Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "Credit repair leads qualify on what's actually wrong with a credit report, not on income or total debt load.",
    metaDescription: "Credit repair leads qualify on documented credit report issues and disputes, not income or debt load. Learn how to screen bulk credit repair volume correctly.",
    category: "Financial Leads",
    readTime: "6 min read",
